feat(quotes): manual draft flow — closes the sales-cycle loop for tenants

Product Director's "First Quote in 90 Seconds" recommendation, scoped to
the manual path. The AI Drafter for tenants ships behind the real Resend
+ Twilio send pipeline + the citation guardrail (Trust + AI directors'
prerequisites); this gets a tenant quoting on Day 1 without waiting on
that pipeline.

What's wired:
- New /app/quotes/draft route — server component pulls the tenant's
  customers, hands them to a client-side DraftQuoteForm with a
  type-as-you-go customer search + "Change customer" pivot.
- Form fields: customer (required, searchable), title (required), total
  $, language toggle (when tenant.bilingual), notes textarea. Auto-
  focus on the search box. Empty-state CTA when zero customers in book
  ("Add a customer first").
- New createDraftQuote() server action — tenant-scoped insert into
  proposals (status='draft', vertical=tenant.vertical, ai_drafted=false,
  bom={title, notes}), audit_log row written best-effort. Routes back to
  /app/quotes on success.
- Pre-fill via querystring: /app/quotes/draft?customer=<id> binds the
  selected customer immediately. Wired from a new "Draft a quote"
  button on /app/customers/[id] header — Cristian opens a property,
  one tap drafts a quote against that customer.

/app/quotes itself rebuilt for tenant sessions:
- Was a TenantEmptyState — now reads the proposals table for the tenant
  and renders a real KPI band (Drafts / In flight / Pipeline / Win rate)
  + a clean table with status pills (draft / sent / viewed / walked /
  sold / installed / lost color-coded via StatusPill tones).
- Empty-state when no proposals: large "Draft a quote" CTA. The page
  goes from "nothing to do here" to "actionable on Day 1."
- Demo session preserves the existing Cypress Lawn QuotesKanban path.

Verification:
- npx tsc --noEmit clean
- npm run lint clean (one Next.js no-html-link-for-pages warning fixed
  by replacing <a> with <Link prefetch>)
- npm run build registers /app/quotes/draft (3.24 kB), /app/quotes
  (3.47 kB tenant, was sharing route with demo).

Day-1 sales loop now end-to-end:
  Add customer → Customer detail → "Draft a quote" → quote saves to
  proposals → list shows on /app/quotes with KPIs.
